b12x
  https://github.com/local-inference-lab/b12x
  Copyright the b12x contributors (local-inference-lab). Apache License, Version 2.0.
  patches/0006-cuda-roce-allgather.patch: tensorfold/cuda/roce_proxy.c is b12x's RDMA proxy
  (b12x/comm/roce/_roce_proxy.c at commit 8a99d639410e39d5f39cb4037675331beceea1d4), modified: the multi-Spark
  (TP=3/4) patch extends it to up to 4 HCAs with a GID index each and per-peer routes (each peer's stripes over the
  HCAs that share its subnet), proxy ABI 5; with no routes set it behaves as b12x's file. Its header lists these
  changes. tensorfold/cuda/roce.cu reimplements b12x's CuTe DSL all-gather kernel (b12x/comm/roce/_allgather_cute.py
  at the same commit) in CUDA C++, with the same stages and memory orderings.

